{"path":"test/language/expressions/logical-or/S11.11.2_A3_T3.js","sha256":"2034e4e989570a8bb881916cd51a820ec044663f1911169ca72f9e41a10a2d4c","status":"adapted","reason":"上游空字符串左值选择普通或包装右值。ZX 显式编译空串和非空串位于两侧的表达式，全部 type_mismatch，不用 false 替换字符串伪称等价；String 包装构造与身份不适用。","contract":"packages/core/IR契约.md#表达式与求值","cases":["language/types/logical_or/literal/empty_string/left/false","language/types/logical_or/literal/empty_string/left/true","language/types/logical_or/literal/empty_string/right/false","language/types/logical_or/literal/empty_string/right/true","language/types/logical_or/literal/nonempty_string/left/false","language/types/logical_or/literal/nonempty_string/left/true","language/types/logical_or/literal/nonempty_string/right/false","language/types/logical_or/literal/nonempty_string/right/true"],"diagnostics":[{"case":"language/types/logical_or/literal/empty_string/left/false","phase":"analyze","code":"type_mismatch"},{"case":"language/types/logical_or/literal/empty_string/left/true","phase":"analyze","code":"type_mismatch"},{"case":"language/types/logical_or/literal/empty_string/right/false","phase":"analyze","code":"type_mismatch"},{"case":"language/types/logical_or/literal/empty_string/right/true","phase":"analyze","code":"type_mismatch"},{"case":"language/types/logical_or/literal/nonempty_string/left/false","phase":"analyze","code":"type_mismatch"},{"case":"language/types/logical_or/literal/nonempty_string/left/true","phase":"analyze","code":"type_mismatch"},{"case":"language/types/logical_or/literal/nonempty_string/right/false","phase":"analyze","code":"type_mismatch"},{"case":"language/types/logical_or/literal/nonempty_string/right/true","phase":"analyze","code":"type_mismatch"}],"assertions":[]}
{"path":"test/language/expressions/logical-or/S11.11.2_A3_T4.js","sha256":"5071855412d887dd6c914cda58b6a8d78268bd16e9e7d8965b41e58e922bf18d","status":"adapted","reason":"上游 false 左值选择 undefined/null 右值；ZX 明确为空的 bool? RHS 不能作为逻辑操作数，分析期拒绝。undefined 没有对应类型，单独记为设计不适用，不将其偷换成 null。","contract":"packages/core/IR契约.md#表达式与求值","cases":["language/types/logical_or/literal/null_optional/right/false"],"diagnostics":[{"case":"language/types/logical_or/literal/null_optional/right/false","phase":"analyze","code":"type_mismatch"}],"assertions":[]}
